{"title": "Probability (Past Year Questions)", "duration_min": 10.0, "questions": [{"q_en": "<p>A speaks the truth 5 out of 7 times and B speaks truth 8 out of 9 times. What is the probability that they contradict each other in stating the same fact?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>A, 7 &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; 5 &#2348;&#2366;&#2352; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2348;&#2379;&#2354;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; B, 9 &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; 8 &#2348;&#2366;&#2352; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2348;&#2379;&#2354;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2313;&#2344;&#2325;&#2375; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2340;&#2341;&#2381;&#2351; &#2325;&#2379; &#2325;&#2361;&#2344;&#2375; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2319;&#2325; &#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2326;&#2306;&#2337;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2351;&#2367;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["1/7", "1/9", "1/4", "1/3"], "options_hi": ["1/7", "1/9", "1/4", "1/3"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>P(A) = 5/7</p><p>P(B) = 8/9</p><p>Probability that A lies = 1-5/7 = 2/7</p><p>Probability that B lies = 1-8/9 = 1/9</p><p>Required probability = P(A) * P(B') + P(A') * P(B)</p><p>= (5/7) * (1/9) + (2/7) * (8/9)</p><p>= 5/63 + 16/63</p><p>= 21/63</p><p>= 1/3</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>P(A) = 5/7</p><p>P(B) = 8/9</p><p>Probability that A lies = 1-5/7 = 2/7</p><p>Probability that B lies = 1-8/9 = 1/9</p><p>Required probability = P(A) * P(B') + P(A') * P(B)</p><p>= (5/7) * (1/9) + (2/7) * (8/9)</p><p>= 5/63 + 16/63</p><p>= 21/63</p><p>= 1/3</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Three cards are drawn one after another with replacement from a pack of cards. What is the probability of getting first card a Jack, second card a black card, and third card an even numbered card?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2340;&#2366;&#2358; &#2325;&#2368; &#2319;&#2325; &#2327;&#2337;&#2381;&#2337;&#2368; &#2360;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2346;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341; &#2319;&#2325; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2319;&#2325; &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2340;&#2368;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337; &#2344;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;&#2354;&#2375; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337; &#2325;&#2375; &#2332;&#2376;&#2325;, &#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337; &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337; &#2324;&#2352; &#2340;&#2368;&#2360;&#2352;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337; &#2325;&#2375; &#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337; &#2361;&#2379;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2351;&#2367;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["5/169", "5/338", "25/26", "20/338"], "options_hi": ["5/169", "5/338", "25/26", "20/338"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Probability of drawing a Jack from a pack of cards = 4/52 = 1/13</p><p>Probability of drawing a black card from a pack of cards = 26/52 = 1/2</p><p>Probability of drawing an even numbered card from a pack of cards = 20/52 = 5/13</p><p>Required probability = 1/13 * &frac12; * 5/13</p><p>= 5/338</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Probability of drawing a Jack from a pack of cards = 4/52 = 1/13</p><p>Probability of drawing a black card from a pack of cards = 26/52 = 1/2</p><p>Probability of drawing an even numbered card from a pack of cards = 20/52 = 5/13</p><p>Required probability = 1/13 * &frac12; * 5/13</p><p>= 5/338</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If A and B are two events such that P(A &#8899; B) = 3/4, P(A &#8898; B) = 1/4 and P(B) = 1/2, then the events A and B are _____.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; A &#2324;&#2352; B &#2342;&#2379; &#2328;&#2335;&#2344;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2311;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2325;&#2367; P(A &#8899; B) = 3/4, P(A &#8898; B) = 1/4 &#2324;&#2352; P(B) = 1/2 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2328;&#2335;&#2344;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; A &#2324;&#2352; B _____ &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["Not mutually", "Mutually exclusive", "Independent", "Dependent"], "options_hi": ["&#2346;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2352; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306;", "&#2346;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2352; &#2309;&#2344;&#2344;&#2381;&#2351;", "&#2360;&#2381;&#2357;&#2340;&#2306;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;", "&#2310;&#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2340;"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>P(A &#8899; B) = P(A) + P(B)  -  P(A &#8898; B)</p><p>3/4 = P(A) + &frac12; - &#188;</p><p>P(A) = 3/4  -  &#188; = 1/2</p><p>P(A) * P(B) = 1/2 * &frac12; = 1/4 = P(A &#8898; B)</p><p>So, A and B are independent event.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>P(A &#8899; B) = P(A) + P(B)  -  P(A &#8898; B)</p><p>3/4 = P(A) + &frac12; - &#188;</p><p>P(A) = 3/4  -  &#188; = 1/2</p><p>P(A) * P(B) = 1/2 * &frac12; = 1/4 = P(A &#8898; B)</p><p>So, A and B are independent event.</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A person can hit a target 5 times out of 8 shots. If he fires 10 shots, what is the probability that he will hit the target twice?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; 8 &#2358;&#2377;&#2335; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; 5 &#2348;&#2366;&#2352; &#2354;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2381;&#2351; &#2349;&#2375;&#2342; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2357;&#2361; 10 &#2358;&#2377;&#2335; &#2347;&#2366;&#2351;&#2352; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2354;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2381;&#2351; &#2325;&#2379; &#2342;&#2379; &#2348;&#2366;&#2352; &#2349;&#2375;&#2342;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2351;&#2367;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376; ?</p>", "options_en": ["(1135 X 3<sup>8</sup>)/8<sup>10</sup>", "(1165 X 3<sup>8</sup>)/8<sup>10</sup>", "(1175 X 3<sup>8</sup>)/8<sup>10</sup>", "(1125 X 3<sup>8</sup>)/8<sup>10</sup>"], "options_hi": ["(1135 X 3<sup>8</sup>)/8<sup>10</sup>", "(1165 X 3<sup>8</sup>)/8<sup>10</sup>", "(1175 X 3<sup>8</sup>)/8<sup>10</sup>", "(1125 X 3<sup>8</sup>)/8<sup>10</sup>"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Probability of hitting the target P(H) = 5/8</p><p>Probability of not hitting the target P(H') = 1  -  5/8 = 3/8</p><p>If the person hit the target twice then he will not hit exactly 8 shots.</p><p>Probability that he will hit the target twice = <sup>10</sup>C<sub>2</sub> * [P(H)]<sup>2</sup> * [P(H')]<sup>8</sup></p><p>= (10*9/2) * (5/8)<sup>2</sup> * (3/8)<sup>8</sup></p><p>= 45 * 25 * 3<sup>8</sup>/8<sup>10</sup></p><p>= (1125*3<sup>8</sup>)/8<sup>10</sup></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Probability of hitting the target P(H) = 5/8</p><p>Probability of not hitting the target P(H') = 1  -  5/8 = 3/8</p><p>If the person hit the target twice then he will not hit exactly 8 shots.</p><p>Probability that he will hit the target twice = <sup>10</sup>C<sub>2</sub> * [P(H)]<sup>2</sup> * [P(H')]<sup>8</sup></p><p>= (10*9/2) * (5/8)<sup>2</sup> * (3/8)<sup>8</sup></p><p>= 45 * 25 * 3<sup>8</sup>/8<sup>10</sup></p><p>= (1125*3<sup>8</sup>)/8<sup>10</sup></p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>In grade 11 of a school, 40 students opted for Physics, 17 opted for Biology, and 20 opted for Chemistry. If the total number of students in grade 11 was 60, all of these students opted for at least one of the three subjects mentioned here, and exactly five of these students opted for all these three subjects, what is the probability that a randomly selected student of grade 11 of this school would have opted for exactly one of these three subjects? </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2381;&#2325;&#2370;&#2354; &#2325;&#2375; 11&#2357;&#2368;&#2306; &#2325;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; 40 &#2331;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2344;&#2375; &#2349;&#2380;&#2340;&#2367;&#2325;&#2368;, 17 &#2344;&#2375; &#2332;&#2368;&#2357;&#2357;&#2367;&#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2344; &#2324;&#2352; 20 &#2344;&#2375; &#2352;&#2360;&#2366;&#2351;&#2344; &#2357;&#2367;&#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 11&#2357;&#2368;&#2306; &#2325;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2331;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; 60 &#2341;&#2368;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2311;&#2344; &#2360;&#2349;&#2368; &#2331;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2344;&#2375; &#2351;&#2361;&#2366;&#2305; &#2348;&#2340;&#2366;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2340;&#2368;&#2344; &#2357;&#2367;&#2359;&#2351;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2350; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2350; &#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2367;&#2359;&#2351; &#2330;&#2369;&#2344;&#2366;, &#2324;&#2352; &#2311;&#2344;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2336;&#2368;&#2325; &#2346;&#2366;&#2305;&#2330; &#2331;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2344;&#2375; &#2311;&#2344; &#2340;&#2368;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2357;&#2367;&#2359;&#2351;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2330;&#2369;&#2344;&#2366;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2360;&#2306;&#2349;&#2366;&#2357;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2325;&#2367; &#2311;&#2360; &#2360;&#2381;&#2325;&#2370;&#2354; &#2325;&#2375; 11&#2357;&#2368;&#2306; &#2325;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2319;&#2325; &#2351;&#2366;&#2342;&#2371;&#2330;&#2381;&#2331;&#2367;&#2325; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2330;&#2369;&#2344;&#2375; &#2327;&#2319; &#2331;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352; &#2344;&#2375; &#2311;&#2344; &#2340;&#2368;&#2344; &#2357;&#2367;&#2359;&#2351;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2336;&#2368;&#2325; &#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2367;&#2359;&#2351; &#2330;&#2369;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p>", "options_en": ["0.75", "0.85", "0.90", "0.80"], "options_hi": ["0.75", "0.85", "0.90", "0.80"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Total number of students = 60</p><p>Number of students who opted two or more subjects = 40 + 17 + 20 + 5  -  60 = 12</p><p>Number of students who opted exactly one subject = 60 - 12 = 48</p><p>Probability = 48/60 = 0.8</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Total number of students = 60</p><p>Number of students who opted two or more subjects = 40 + 17 + 20 + 5  -  60 = 12</p><p>Number of students who opted exactly one subject = 60 - 12 = 48</p><p>Probability = 48/60 = 0.8</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If A and B are 2 events with P(A) =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">3</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">8</span></div>&nbsp;, P(B) =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">2</span></div>&nbsp;and P(A&cap;B) =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">4</span></div>&nbsp;. Find P(<span style='text-decoration:overline'>A</span> &cap; <span style='text-decoration:overline'>B</span>)&nbsp;</div></p><p></p>", "q_hi": "<p><div>&nbsp;&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; A &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; B &#2342;&#2379; &#2328;&#2335;&#2344;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2332;&#2367;&#2344;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; P(A) =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">3</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">8</span></div>&nbsp;, P(B) =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">2</span></div>&nbsp;&amp; P(A&cap;B) =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">4</span></div>&nbsp;. P(<span style='text-decoration:overline'>A</span> &cap; <span style='text-decoration:overline'>B</span>) &#2326;&#2379;&#2332;&#2375;&#2306;&nbsp;</div></p><p></p>", "options_en": ["1/8", "3/8", "7/8", "5/8"], "options_hi": ["1/8", "3/8", "7/8", "5/8"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>P(A) = 3/8, P(B) = 1/2, P(A &#8898; B) = 1/4</p><p>P(A &#8899; B) = P(A) + P(B)  -  P(A &#8898; B)</p><p>P(A &#8899; B) = 3/8 + &frac12; - &#188;</p><p>P(A &#8899; B) = 5/8</p><p>P(A' &#8745; B') = 1 - P(A U B)</p><p>= 1  -  5/8</p><p>= 3/8</p><p></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>P(A) = 3/8, P(B) = 1/2, P(A &#8898; B) = 1/4</p><p>P(A &#8899; B) = P(A) + P(B)  -  P(A &#8898; B)</p><p>P(A &#8899; B) = 3/8 + &frac12; - &#188;</p><p>P(A &#8899; B) = 5/8</p><p>P(A' &#8745; B') = 1 - P(A U B)</p><p>= 1  -  5/8</p><p>= 3/8</p><p></p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>The probabilities of solving a problem by three students A, B and C are 3/7, 5/9 and 1/5, respectively. The probability that problem will be solved is:</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2340;&#2368;&#2344; &#2357;&#2367;&#2342;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2351;&#2379;&#2306; A, B &#2324;&#2352; C &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350;&#2360;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2379; &#2361;&#2354; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2351;&#2367;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; 3/7, 5/9 &#2324;&#2352; 1/5 &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p><p>&#2360;&#2350;&#2360;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2361;&#2354; &#2361;&#2379;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2351;&#2367;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;:</p>", "options_en": ["155/315", "64/315", "251/315", "32/315"], "options_hi": ["155/315", "64/315", "251/315", "32/315"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>P(A) = 3/7, P(B) = 5/9, P(C) = 1/5</p><p>Required probability = 1  -  (Probability that the problem is not solved)</p><p>= 1  -  P(A')P(B')P(C')</p><p>= 1  -  (1  -  3/7)(1  -  5/9)(1  -  1/5)</p><p>= 1 -  (4/7) * (4/9) * (4/5)</p><p>= 1  -  64/315</p><p>= 251/315</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>P(A) = 3/7, P(B) = 5/9, P(C) = 1/5</p><p>Required probability = 1  -  (Probability that the problem is not solved)</p><p>= 1  -  P(A')P(B')P(C')</p><p>= 1  -  (1  -  3/7)(1  -  5/9)(1  -  1/5)</p><p>= 1 -  (4/7) * (4/9) * (4/5)</p><p>= 1  -  64/315</p><p>= 251/315</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A die is cast twice and a coin is tossed thrice. Find the probability that the die will turn a 5 each time and the coin will turn a head every time.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2346;&#2366;&#2360;&#2366; &#2342;&#2379; &#2348;&#2366;&#2352; &#2313;&#2331;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2325;&#2366; &#2340;&#2368;&#2344; &#2348;&#2366;&#2352; &#2313;&#2331;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2311;&#2360; &#2348;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2351;&#2367;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2367; &#2346;&#2366;&#2360;&#2366; &#2361;&#2352; &#2348;&#2366;&#2352; 5 &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2366; &#2324;&#2352; &#2360;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2325;&#2366; &#2361;&#2352; &#2348;&#2366;&#2352; &#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2366;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["1/50", "1/200", "1/100", "1/288"], "options_hi": ["1/50", "1/200", "1/100", "1/288"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Die P(5) = 1/6, twice = (1/6) * (1/6) = 1/36</p><p>Coin P(H) = 1/2, thrice = (1/2)^3 = 1/8</p><p>Total = (1/36) * (1/8) = 1/288</p><p>Option (d) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Die P(5) = 1/6, twice = (1/6) * (1/6) = 1/36</p><p>Coin P(H) = 1/2, thrice = (1/2)^3 = 1/8</p><p>Total = (1/36) * (1/8) = 1/288</p><p>Option (d) is the correct answer.</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If P(A &cup; B) =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">5</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">9</span></div>&nbsp;, P(<span style='text-decoration:overline'>A</span> &cup; <span style='text-decoration:overline'>B</span>) =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">13</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">27</span></div>&nbsp;, P(A) =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">11</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">18</span></div>&nbsp;, then the odds against the event B are:&nbsp;</div></p><p></p>", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; P(A &#8746; B) = <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">5</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">9</span></div>&nbsp;, P(<span style='text-decoration:overline'>A</span> &cup; <span style='text-decoration:overline'>B</span>) =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">13</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">27</span></div>&nbsp;, P(A) =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">11</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">18</span></div>&nbsp;&#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2328;&#2335;&#2344;&#2366; B &#2325;&#2375; &#2357;&#2367;&#2352;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2351;&#2367;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;:</div></p>", "options_en": ["47/7", "7/57", "38/17", "29/25"], "options_hi": ["47/7", "7/57", "38/17", "29/25"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p><img width=89 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image002.png\"></p><p><img width=71 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image003.png\"></p><p><img width=99 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image004.png\"></p><p><img width=195 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image005.png\"></p><p><img width=155 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image006.png\"></p><p>We know that:</p><p><img width=231 height=23 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image007.png\"></p><p><img width=128 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image008.png\"></p><p><img width=260 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image009.png\"></p><p><img width=127 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image010.png\"></p><p>Now, odds against the event:</p><p><img width=88 height=71 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image011.png\"></p><p>= 29/25</p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=89 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image002.png\"></p><p><img width=71 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image003.png\"></p><p><img width=99 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image004.png\"></p><p><img width=195 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image005.png\"></p><p><img width=155 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image006.png\"></p><p>We know that:</p><p><img width=231 height=23 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image007.png\"></p><p><img width=128 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image008.png\"></p><p><img width=260 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image009.png\"></p><p><img width=127 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image010.png\"></p><p>Now, odds against the event:</p><p><img width=88 height=71 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23683/image011.png\"></p><p>= 29/25</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Sudarsan and Abraham appear for an interview for two vacancies. The probability of Sudarsan's selection is 1/3 and that of Abraham's selection is 1/5. Find the probability that none of them be selected.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2360;&#2369;&#2342;&#2352;&#2381;&#2358;&#2344; &#2324;&#2352; &#2309;&#2348;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2361;&#2350; &#2342;&#2379; &#2352;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367;&#2351;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2360;&#2366;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2313;&#2346;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2360;&#2369;&#2342;&#2352;&#2381;&#2358;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2349;&#2366;&#2357;&#2344;&#2366; 1/3 &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2309;&#2348;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2361;&#2350; &#2325;&#2375; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2349;&#2366;&#2357;&#2344;&#2366; 1/5 &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2313;&#2344;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2325;&#2375; &#2349;&#2368; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344;&#2367;&#2340; &#2344; &#2361;&#2379;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2349;&#2366;&#2357;&#2344;&#2366; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["8/15", "14/15", "1/15", "22/15"], "options_hi": ["8/15", "14/15", "1/15", "22/15"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Probability of Sudarsan's selection = 1/3</p><p>probability of Abraham's selection = 1/5</p><p>P(Sudarsan not selected) = 1 - 1/3 = 2/3</p><p>P(Abraham not selected) = 1 - 1/5 = 4/5</p><p>P(none) = 2/3 * 4/5 = 8/15</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Probability of Sudarsan's selection = 1/3</p><p>probability of Abraham's selection = 1/5</p><p>P(Sudarsan not selected) = 1 - 1/3 = 2/3</p><p>P(Abraham not selected) = 1 - 1/5 = 4/5</p><p>P(none) = 2/3 * 4/5 = 8/15</p>"}]}